{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.beta_decay_transfer_matrix","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.beta_decay_transfer_matrix","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Determinant.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.TransferMatrix"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.beta_decay_transfer_matrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.beta_decay_transfer_matrix","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L87-L110","doc":"**Beta-decay transfer matrices** (manuscript claims (i)–(iii)).\n\nBeta decay is mediated by the `T_{3,5}` torus knot, whose insertion at the\nconverting quark produces the universal `2×2` matrix-valued polynomial\n`Δ_β(q)`.  The three crossing transfer matrices `T_pp`, `T_nn`, `T_mix`\nsatisfy:\n\n* (i) `tr T_pp = q − q⁻¹`, `tr T_nn = −(q − q⁻¹)`, `tr T_mix = 0`;\n* (ii) `det T_pp = det T_nn = −1` (Hecke unimodularity, forced by the\n  eigenvalues `q · (−q⁻¹) = −1`);\n* (iii) the two elementary decay matrices coincide,\n  `T_mix − T_nn = T_pp − T_mix` (the single universal `Δ_β`).\n\nAll three are **derived** from the explicit entries — the lone input is\nthe substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:beta-decay-transfer-matrix","label":"prop:beta-decay-transfer-matrix","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/beta-decay-transfer-matrix.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.universal_delta_beta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.universal_delta_beta","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L79-L85","doc":"**Universal `Δ_β`** — the two elementary decay matrices coincide:\n`T_mix − T_nn = T_pp − T_mix` (derived entrywise). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.det_T_nn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.det_T_nn","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L75-L77","doc":"`det T_nn = −1` — Hecke unimodularity (derived). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.det_T_pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.det_T_pp","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L71-L73","doc":"`det T_pp = −1` — Hecke unimodularity (derived). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.trace_T_mix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.trace_T_mix","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L67-L69","doc":"Trace of `T_mix` is `0` (derived). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.trace_T_nn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.trace_T_nn","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L63-L65","doc":"Trace of `T_nn` is `−(q − q⁻¹)` (derived). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.trace_T_pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.trace_T_pp","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L59-L61","doc":"Trace of `T_pp` is `q − q⁻¹` (derived). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.T_mix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.T_mix","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L55-L57","doc":"`T_mix(q) = T(1, −½(q − q⁻¹))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.T_nn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.T_nn","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L51-L53","doc":"`T_nn(q) = T(1, −(q − q⁻¹)) = !![0, 1; 1, −(q − q⁻¹)]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.T_pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.T_pp","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L48-L49","doc":"`T_pp(q) = T(1, 0) = !![q − q⁻¹, 1; 1, 0]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.betaTransfer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BetaDecayTransfer.betaTransfer","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/beta_decay_transfer_matrix.lean#L43-L46","doc":"The crossing transfer matrix `T(c, d) = !![c·(q − q⁻¹) + d, c; c, d]`\nof the manuscript (a `2×2` matrix over `ℝ`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}